unty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years back to 1951, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids July to August came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025, September to October came in at 35% of normal and January to February at 34% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 185% of normal on the middle. Grid 26561 had its driest year in 1988 at 58% of normal.</p>"}
